      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What sort of links can quest users watch that PC players cannot?\n\nIf you use a service that hosts mp4 files they work on both quest and PC. \n\nI believe official VRChat documentation on video players explains the issue with youtube links. \n\nI have seen a lot of worlds that don't properly link PC and quest version, really annoying when the pool table is there but can't play cross platform. Maybe your favorite world has bad sync cross platform? I even saw a world recently where video player was effectively local only. Wouldn't even sync up fellow PC users...",
